{"id":"exterior.http","number":"6.3","part":"exterior","kind":"leccion","title":[{"type":"text","text":"Talking to the internet"}],"minutes":30,"levels":["semilla","brote","arbol"],"needs":[{"id":"exterior.json","number":"6.2","title":"Data that programs understand"}],"introduces":[{"id":"peticion","label":"HTTP request"},{"id":"codigo-de-estado","label":"status code"}],"brief_problem":"The price of imported fruit","previous":{"id":"exterior.json","number":"6.2","title":"Data that programs understand"},"next":{"id":"exterior.proyecto","number":"P·F","title":"Final project: the complete kiosk"},"blocks":[{"type":"phrase","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"A program asks another one something over the internet by sending a request, and the answer brings a code that says how it went."}]},{"type":"heading","id":"problema","number":"","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"The problem"}]},{"type":"problem","blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Imported fruit costs "},{"type":"strong","text":"2 dollars"},{"type":"text","text":", and the kiosk charges in pesos according to the "},{"type":"strong","text":"day's exchange rate"},{"type":"text","text":", which a service publishes on the internet. Sometimes the service answers and sometimes it does not."}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"strong","text":"How much does the kiosk charge today for imported fruit, and what does it do if the service does not answer?"}]}]},{"type":"heading","id":"intentalo","number":"","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Try it"}]},{"type":"attempt","prompt":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"If the service says that a dollar is worth 20 pesos, how much does the fruit cost? And if it does not answer?"}]}],"answer":[{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"strong","text":"40 pesos"},{"type":"text","text":". If it does not answer, the kiosk cannot make up a price: it warns that the service is not available."}]}]},{"type":"cycle","phases":[1,2]},{"type":"phase_heading","id":"entender-planear","phases":[1,2],"runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Understand and plan"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"entries":[[{"type":"strong","text":"What goes in and what comes out?"},{"type":"text","text":" The answer of the service goes in; out comes the price in pesos or a warning."}],[{"type":"strong","text":"What does it look like?"},{"type":"text","text":" The inventory of the previous lesson: a JSON text that arrives from outside and has to be read."}],[{"type":"strong","text":"What can fail outside the program?"},{"type":"text","text":" The network may not be there, the service may answer an error and the answer may come badly written."}]]},{"type":"heading","id":"herramienta","number":"","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"The new tool"}]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"definition","term":"peticion","text":"HTTP request"},{"type":"text","text":" asks another program for something over the internet. To send it, the program asks for the network capability with "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["SolicitarRed","identifier"]]},{"type":"text","text":", just as it asked for that of a folder. The answer brings a text, the body, and a "},{"type":"definition","term":"codigo-de-estado","text":"status code"},{"type":"text","text":" that says how it went: 200 is fine; those that start with 4 or with 5 are problems."}]},{"type":"spec_figure","section":"biblioteca.http","number":"12.9","figure":{"type":"figure","id":"http-ida-vuelta","number":"12.9-1","alt":"Request and response","description":"The program sends a GET request to the server and receives a 200 response with its body. Responses, including 404 and 500, are Success; transport failures are Error.","caption":[{"type":"text","text":"The request goes out through the network capability and a response comes back. A 404 or a 500 are responses, not errors: only transport failures arrive as "},{"type":"code","tokens":[["ErrorES","type"]]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"svg":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 340 170\" width=\"340\" height=\"170\"><title>Request and response</title><desc>The program sends a GET request to the server and receives a 200 response with its body. Responses, including 404 and 500, are Success; transport failures are Error.</desc><rect x=\"6\" y=\"40\" width=\"96\" height=\"60\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF0003\" fill-opacity=\"0.1\" stroke=\"#FF0003\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"54\" y=\"74.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">program</text><rect x=\"238\" y=\"40\" width=\"96\" height=\"60\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#FF000B\" fill-opacity=\"0.08\" stroke=\"#FF000B\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"286\" y=\"74.2\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\" fill=\"#FF0001\">server</text><polyline points=\"104,56 228,56\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF0004\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"236,56 228,60.5 228,51.5\" fill=\"#FF0004\"/><polyline points=\"236,86 112,86\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FF0009\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polygon points=\"104,86 112,81.5 112,90.5\" fill=\"#FF0009\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBMPlexMono\" fill=\"#FF0004\">GET /hoy</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"104\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"IBMPlexMono\" fill=\"#FF0009\">200 · Soleado, 25</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF0001\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\">200, 404, 500: Success with the response</text><text x=\"170\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#FF000A\" font-family=\"IBMPlexSans\">no connection: Error(IoError)</text></svg>","layers":[],"steps":[],"panels":[]}},{"type":"program","id":"clima","title":"Asking for the weather","source":"SubProceso CheckWeather() Como Resultado<Cadena, ErrorES>\n  Definir network Como RedCap <- Propagar SolicitarRed();\n  Definir request Como PeticionHttp <- PeticionHttp(MetodoHttp.GET, \"https://clima.test/hoy\");\n  Definir response Como RespuestaHttp <- Propagar network.Enviar(request);\n  Escribir \"Status: \", response.Estado();\n  Retornar response.CuerpoTexto();\nFinSubProceso\n\nAlgoritmo Weather\n  Segun CheckWeather() Hacer\n    Exito(text): Escribir text;\n    Error(report): Escribir report.Codigo;\n  FinSegun\nFinAlgoritmo\n","lines":[[["SubProceso","keywordProcedural"],[" "],["CheckWeather","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],[")","punctuation"],[" "],["Como","punctuation"],[" "],["Resultado","type"],["<","operator"],["Cadena","type"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["ErrorES","type"],[">","operator"]],[["  "],["Definir","keywordStructured"],[" "],["network","identifier"],[" "],["Como","punctuation"],[" "],["RedCap","type"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["Propagar","keywordStructured"],[" "],["SolicitarRed","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],[")","punctuation"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Definir","keywordStructured"],[" "],["request","identifier"],[" "],["Como","punctuation"],[" "],["PeticionHttp","type"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["PeticionHttp","type"],["(","punctuation"],["MetodoHttp","type"],[".","punctuation"],["GET","identifier"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["\"https://clima.test/hoy\"","literalString"],[")","punctuation"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Definir","keywordStructured"],[" "],["response","identifier"],[" "],["Como","punctuation"],[" "],["RespuestaHttp","type"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["Propagar","keywordStructured"],[" "],["network","identifier"],[".","punctuation"],["Enviar","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],["request","identifier"],[")","punctuation"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Escribir","keywordStructured"],[" "],["\"Status: \"","literalString"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["response","identifier"],[".","punctuation"],["Estado","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],[")","punctuation"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Retornar","keywordProcedural"],[" "],["response","identifier"],[".","punctuation"],["CuerpoTexto","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],[")","punctuation"],[";","punctuation"]],[["FinSubProceso","keywordProcedural"]],[],[["Algoritmo","keywordStructured"],[" "],["Weather","identifier"]],[["  "],["Segun","keywordStructured"],[" "],["CheckWeather","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],[")","punctuation"],[" "],["Hacer","keywordStructured"]],[["    "],["Exito","literalBoolean"],["(","punctuation"],["text","identifier"],[")","punctuation"],[":","punctuation"],[" "],["Escribir","keywordStructured"],[" "],["text","identifier"],[";","punctuation"]],[["    "],["Error","literalBoolean"],["(","punctuation"],["report","identifier"],[")","punctuation"],[":","punctuation"],[" "],["Escribir","keywordStructured"],[" "],["report","identifier"],[".","punctuation"],["Codigo","identifier"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["FinSegun","keywordStructured"]],[["FinAlgoritmo","keywordStructured"]]],"executed":true,"output":"Status: 200\nSunny, 25\n","termination":"completed","diagnostics":[]},{"type":"paragraph","runs":[{"type":"text","text":"The service of this example is not real: the memory host answers in its place, always the same. That way the program can be tested without the internet."}]},{"type":"spec_links","links":[{"section":"biblioteca.http","number":"12.9","title":"HTTP"},{"section":"biblioteca.json","number":"12.8","title":"JSON"}]},{"type":"cycle","phases":[3]},{"type":"phase_heading","id":"escribir","phases":[3],"runs":[{"type":"text","text":"Write"}]},{"type":"program","id":"cambio","title":"The imported fruit","source":"Funcion pesos <- PriceInPesos(dollars Como Entero, rate Como Entero)\n  Definir pesos Como Entero;\n  pesos <- dollars * rate;\nFinFuncion\n\nFuncion message <- PriceMessage(body Como Cadena)\n  Definir message Como Cadena <- \"The response has no rate\";\n  Segun AnalizarJson(body) Hacer\n    Exito(data):\n      Segun data.Campo(\"dollar\") Hacer\n        Algo(dollar):\n          Segun dollar.ComoEntero() Hacer\n            Algo(rate): message <- \"Imported fruit: \" + ATexto(PriceInPesos(2, rate)) + \" pesos\";\n            Nada: message <- \"The rate is not a number\";\n          FinSegun\n        Nada: message <- \"The response has no rate\";\n      FinSegun\n    Error(report): message <- \"Badly written response at column \" + ATexto(report.JsonColumna);\n  FinSegun\nFinFuncion\n\nSubProceso RequestRate() Como Resultado<Cadena, ErrorES>\n  Definir network Como RedCap <- Propagar SolicitarRed();\n  Definir response Como RespuestaHttp <- Propagar network.Enviar(PeticionHttp(MetodoHttp.GET, \"https://cambio.test/hoy\"));\n  Si response.Estado() <> 200 Entonces\n    Retornar Exito(\"Service unavailable (\" + ATexto(response.Estado()) + \")\");\n  FinSi\n  Definir body Como Cadena <- Propagar response.CuerpoTexto();\n  Retornar Exito(PriceMessage(body));\nFinSubProceso\n\nAlgoritmo ImportedFruit\n  Segun RequestRate() Hacer\n    Exito(message): Escribir message;\n    Error(report): Escribir \"No network: \", report.Codigo;\n  FinSegun\nFinAlgoritmo\n","lines":[[["Funcion","keywordProcedural"],[" "],["pesos","identifier"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["PriceInPesos","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],["dollars","identifier"],[" "],["Como","punctuation"],[" "],["Entero","type"],[",","punctuation"],[" "],["rate","identifier"],[" "],["Como","punctuation"],[" "],["Entero","type"],[")","punctuation"]],[["  "],["Definir","keywordStructured"],[" "],["pesos","identifier"],[" "],["Como","punctuation"],[" "],["Entero","type"],[";","punctuation"]],[["  "],["pesos","identifier"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["dollars","identifier"],[" "],["*","operator"],[" "],["rate","identifier"],[";","punctuation"]],[["FinFuncion","keywordProcedural"]],[],[["Funcion","keywordProcedural"],[" "],["message","identifier"],[" "],["<-","operator"],[" "],["PriceMessage","identifier"],["(","punctuation"],["body","identifier"],[" "],["Como","punctuation"],[" "],["